  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production FAQs\n\n### How to produce FRS 105 micro company accounts?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 4 Jan, 2022 at  3:35 PM\n\n\t\tYou can create FRS 105  Micro Entity Accounts for the limited companies by changing the company size in the company report settings. To do so follow the navigation as shown below.Navigation: Accounts Production >> Settings >> Report Settings >> Company Info >>  Report Information >> Edit >> Change the Company size and Taxonomy to FRS 105 >> Save\n\nOnce you make the changes please regenerate the report so the changes are reflected. \n\nYou can click on this link to redirect you straight to the page you want to edit. \n\nClick here to watch How to prepare Micro Entity Accounts under FRS 105\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188543\">Accounts Production FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to produce FRS 105 micro company accounts?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 4 Jan, 2022 at  3:35 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"506\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"507\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">You can create FRS 105 &nbsp;Micro Entity Accounts for the limited companies by changing the company size in the company report settings. To do so follow the navigation as shown below.</span><br data-identifyelement=\"508\"><span data-identifyelement=\"509\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"510\"></span><span data-identifyelement=\"511\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"513\" dir=\"ltr\">Navigation:</strong> Accounts Production &gt;&gt; Settings &gt;&gt; Report Settings &gt;&gt; Company Info &gt;&gt; &nbsp;Report Information &gt;&gt; Edit &gt;&gt; Change the Company size and Taxonomy to FRS 105 &gt;&gt; Save</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"506\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"506\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9148418044/original/ydrJ04xMyi4sP4NGa6__0aTeyBr5wj0VNA.png?1641310472\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9148418044\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"514\"><span data-identifyelement=\"515\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"516\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"517\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"518\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9148402049/original/As6yortwOwwoxHyelAyTaQDYbNaGVYuezQ.gif?1641303052\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9148402049\" data-identifyelement=\"519\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-identifyelement=\"521\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"522\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"523\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"524\"><span data-identifyelement=\"525\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"526\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Once you make the changes please regenerate the report so the changes are reflected.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"527\"><br data-identifyelement=\"528\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"529\"><span data-identifyelement=\"530\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"531\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">You can click on this<strong data-identifyelement=\"532\">&nbsp;</strong><a data-identifyelement=\"533\" href=\"https://app.capium.com/accounts/settings/report/company.aspx\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"534\">link&nbsp;</strong></a>to redirect you straight to the page you want to edit.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"537\"><span data-identifyelement=\"538\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"539\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"540\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"541\"><a data-identifyelement=\"542\" href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/04905980289b495b8387cd5d0eec8849\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span data-identifyelement=\"543\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"544\"><span data-identifyelement=\"545\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Click here to watch How to prepare Micro Entity Accounts under FRS 105</span></strong></span></a></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165801\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165801/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165801\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165801/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165801\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vo